 "strings": [
  "",
  "Quattro",
  "\"Ngh!!\"",
  "\"I can't let Scirocco",
  " wreck the laser cannon!!\"",
  "Scirocco",
  "\"I can't let them hit",
  " the Titans fleet...",
  " Where's the core...?\"",
  "\"Is that it?!\"",
  "Haman",
  "\"Scirocco...",
  " out to wreck the laser cannon...",
  " How amusing!!\"",
  "\"Ngh!!",
  " Any more damage and it",
  " won't be able to fire, tch!\"",
  "\"Heh heh... come here to die,",
  " Chaaar?!\"",
  "\"Ugh!!\"",
  "The AEUG",
  "had taken the colony laser,",
  "and the Titans",
  "had been united under",
  "Paptimus Scirocco.",
  "Axis, conserving its own strength,",
  "whittled away at both sides,",
  "scrambling for a postwar foothold.",
  "Meanwhile, inside the colony",
  "laser, on the verge of firing,",
  "four Newtypes, each led there",
  "by a strange fate,",
  "came face to face.",
  "\"Hamaaan!!\"",
  "\"You were quite the actor,",
  " Char Aznable.\"",
  "\"If there is no room",
  " for talk, then this place",
  " will be where you die, yes?\"",
  "\"No... there's one more...",
  " actor here, isn't there?\"",
  "\"Hee hee...\"",
  "\"Indeed...",
  " this kind of theatrics",
  " is Scirocco's domain.\"",
  "\"I am no more than a witness",
  " to history, or so I believe.\"",
  "\"Then stay out of the way!\"",
  "\"I can't do that.\"",
  "\"The world to come will surely",
  " be ruled by a woman, but certainly",
  " not by a woman like you.\"",
  "\"By 'woman,' you mean",
  " a woman who does",
  " whatever you say.\"",
  "\"Any other woman,",
  " you don't count as a woman.\"",
  "\"I resent the suggestion",
  " that I only like such women.",
  " I am calmer than Char.\"",
  "\"I merely wish to witness",
  " the turning of the age.\"",
  "\"You say I'm not calm?\"",
  "\"That's right.",
  " You want the world",
  " in your own hands!\"",
  "\"Scirocco is right, I'd say.",
  " Char, then lend a hand",
  " in restoring the Zabi family.\"",
  "\"Then we can consider",
  " the world's future together.\"",
  "\"Once we've disposed of",
  " this pesky spectator.\"",
  "Char",
  "\"Haman, I simply",
  " don't want to lead the world",
  " in the wrong direction.\"",
  "\"Then let me ask: in a world",
  " rid of the Zabis and the Titans,\"",
  "\"what on earth",
  " do you intend to do?!\"",
  "\"Even without my hand,",
  " the awakening of Newtypes",
  " will change humanity.\"",
  "\"I'll wait for that day.\"",
  "\"I foresee the coming of a genius",
  " to rule this age. For that,",
  " the era must be shaken up!\"",
  "\"Thinking like yours alone",
  " won't change the world.\"",
  "\"The world of men must be",
  " shown the way by force!\"",
  "\"Ugh!!\"",
  "\"If you will not side with me,",
  " I'll simply remove you!",
  " Then I'll restore the Zabi family.\"",
  "\"That will show people",
  " the way plainly enough.\"",
  "\"Don't you see you'll repeat",
  " the same mistakes once again?!\"",
  "\"A man who cannot discern",
  " the needs of the world",
  " should be eliminated!!\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"That's wrong!!\"",
  "\"Kamille!\"",
  "\"Ngh...!!\"",
  "(What pressure!!)",
  "\"Kamille?\"",
  "\"The one who truly",
  " must be eliminated is...!\"",
  "\"It's the people whose souls are",
  " held by Earth's gravity, isn't it!\"",
  "\"But for so many people",
  " to die because of that...",
  " it's wrong!!\"",
  "\"What foolishness.\"",
  "\"Bare emotion like that",
  " may move the masses,",
  " but it won't work on us!!\"",
  "\"What good is building a world",
  " that ignores people's hearts!\"",
  "\"The rabble could do nothing",
  " but drag genius down!",
  " What did they ever achieve?!!\"",
  "\"It has always been a handful",
  " of geniuses who moved the world!\"",
  "\"Wrong!!\"",
  "\"Kamille! Pull back!!\"",
  "\"No way!!\"",
  "\"Petty sentiment will only",
  " lead the world to ruin, you know?",
  " Boy?\"",
  "\"Kamille!!\"",
  "\"You'll all die here!!",
  " After that, it's a matter",
  " between Scirocco and me!!\"",
  "\"Fewer foes, less confusion.\"",
  "The battle, swallowing",
  "the egos of individuals and",
  "of organizations indiscriminately,",
  "seemed to spread outward",
  "with Gryps 2 at its center.",
  "Bright Noa's Masterstroke",
  "The Newtype Myth",
  "Bright Noa",
  "was an ordinary man.",
  "He was an Earth-born elite,",
  "but all such credentials",
  "were blown away",
  "the moment he became captain",
  "of White Base.",
  "From then on,",
  "save for a spell",
  "as a shuttle captain,",
  "he fought on at the front lines,",
  "grumbling, \"Why me?\"",
  "But such a man, often as not,",
  "doggedly carries out his duty",
  "and becomes a hero.",
  "The Bright of this time",
  "was exactly that.",
  "In the thick of the fighting",
  "he repaired Gryps 2, and",
  "what's more, built an encirclement",
  "that can only be called artistic,",
  "and dragged the Titans fleet,",
  "as though caught in a net,",
  "into the colony laser's",
  "line of fire.",
  "He himself neither boasted",
  "of it nor played it down,",
  "but his skill as a fleet commander",
  "stood out to an uncanny degree.",
  "When the postwar Federation",
  "government deemed him dangerous,",
  "he smiled wryly and called it",
  "overrating him, but the verdict",
  "had its reasons.",
  "By now, nearly every ship",
  "of the Titans had been dragged",
  "into Gryps 2's line of fire.",
  "Yet Bright",
  "still had not fired.",
  "For he had detected friendly",
  "units inside the colony laser.",
  "By a commander's reckoning,",
  "the right call was to fire anyway.",
  "But Bright did not.",
  "An ordinary man's normal response",
  "to an abnormal situation.",
  "Embarrassing as it was",
  "to put into words,",
  "he saw his crew as family",
  "and trusted them from the heart.",
  "In this era,",
  "the word \"Newtype\"",
  "took on a life of its own",
  "and was on everyone's lips.",
  "Some said that those who could",
  "use psycommu and bits",
  "were Newtypes,",
  "while others said",
  "they were evolved humans able to",
  "understand each other perfectly,",
  "with no need for war.",
  "Jamitov, for one,",
  "called them people who could share",
  "the bond of a family's hearts",
  "with anyone, on a cosmic scale --",
  "and that came closest",
  "to the truth.",
  "Here, too, Jamitov",
  "understood Revil well.",
  "In fact, however,",
  "what was wanted was the Newtype",
  "as a tool of war,",
  "and the AEUG and Titans alike,",
  "in various ways,",
  "sent people thought",
  "to be Newtypes",
  "into battle.",
  "Those the public spoke of",
  "as Newtypes",
  "were the likes of Kamille",
  "and Char, but Emma Sheen",
  "and Yazan Gable",
  "were also rumored",
  "to be among them.",
  "Indeed,",
  "it is said that the Hambrabi,",
  "flown only by chosen pilots,",
  "carried",
  "a bio-sensor.",
  "In the end, Jerid Messa, too,",
  "went out with a Newtype unit,",
  "piloting a",
  "Baund Doc.",
  "Some say it was a standard model",
  "with its psycommu removed,",
  "but I would rather not believe",
  "that his soul, which had touched",
  "the souls of Lila and Mouar,",
  "stayed Oldtype to the very end.",
  "Rather, it makes more sense",
  "to say that everyone alive",
  "in this era was, in some way,",
  "a Newtype.",
  "But for such a change in people",
  "to be accepted,",
  "the times themselves had to shift.",
  "And so the world, a living thing,",
  "was going through",
  "the pains of giving birth.",
  "\"Lieutenant! You're still here?!\"",
  "\"We'll get out of here together.",
  " Kamille!!\"",
  "\"You still have",
  " things to do, don't you!\"",
  "\"In this war... the people",
  " who died in this war believed",
  " the world would be saved.\"",
  "\"That's why they died.\"",
  "\"I'll believe in you too!\"",
  "\"Do you think a young man like you",
  " throwing his life away",
  " will save the world?!!\"",
  "Fa",
  "\"Lieutenant!!\"",
  "\"It's not old men",
  " who will build the new era!\"",
  "And inside an abandoned colony",
  "not far from Gryps 2,",
  "the Newtypes were about to face",
  "their final battle.",
  "The Radish had already sunk,",
  "and the Titans fleet",
  "was about to follow.",
  "\"Kamille...!?\"",
  "\"Kamille!",
  " You're alive, aren't you!",
  " Kamille!! Answer me!\"",
  "\"Kamille...!!\"",
  "\"...Huh?\"",
  "\"There's a big star going",
  " on and off...\"",
  "\"Ha ha ha...",
  " It's biiig!\"",
  "\"Is it a comet... no!\"",
  "\"No, that's not it.\"",
  "\"Comets move",
  " more like whoosh!\"",
  "\"...!\"",
  "\"It's so hot and stuffy...\"",
  "\"Can't I get out of here?\"",
  "\"H-hey!",
  " ...Let me out!",
  " C'mon!\"",
  "\"Ah... C-Captain,",
  " Captain Bright...!\"",
  "\"Kamille Bidan is...!\"",
  "\"Can you hear me!",
  " Argama!\"",
  "The battle was over.",
  "The recoil of firing",
  "destroyed Gryps 2,",
  "and Kamille Bidan's",
  "mind was shattered.",
  "The Titans fleet collapsed,",
  "and its leader Scirocco died,",
  "but the AEUG, too,",
  "lost nearly all its capital ships,",
  "and its leader,",
  "Quattro Bajeena,",
  "went missing.",
  "The AEUG and the Titans",
  "brought each other down.",
  "Such was the conclusion",
  "of the war known as",
  "the Gryps Conflict.",
  "The de facto victor",
  "was Axis, and from then on",
  "came an age in which Axis,",
  "calling itself Neo Zeon,",
  "ruled nearly all",
  "of the Earth Sphere.",
  "The Argama fought on",
  "even in that era,",
  "but the AEUG's former glory",
  "never returned.",
  "It existed merely",
  "as a force opposing",
  "Neo Zeon's tyranny,",
  "a tyranny without ideals.",
  "The wisdom humanity had amassed",
  "had by now come to serve",
  "nothing but force of arms.",
  "Apart from military technology,",
  "space -- in politics above all --",
  "took a blow that amounted",
  "to near-total destruction,",
  "and stagnated, and regressed.",
  "The adults left the battlefield,",
  "and their places were taken by",
  "boy soldiers in their mid-teens,",
  "an age so young",
  "it defies belief.",
  "Universal Century 0088.",
  "The tale of the tears of time",
  "draws to a close here, for now.",
  "It is a terribly sad",
  "and bitter ending.",
  "Could there have been",
  "no other ending?",
  "Remembering those days,",
  "many would go on",
  "to be haunted by it."
 ]
